Generic single-database configuration with an async dbapi.

Note: `alembic revision --autogenerate` will always propose dropping
`knowledge_base_fts_idx` — it's a raw functional GIN index
(`to_tsvector(...)`) created via `op.execute()` in the initial migration,
which SQLAlchemy's ORM metadata can't represent, so autogenerate can't see
it as already present. This is expected; don't apply that line.